  "description": "Ridley possesses an abundance of cyclocross knowledge and technological innovations, which we applied to the X-Night Disc. Its F-Steerer, a flattened underside of the down tube and a real CX-specific geometry - that's where the X-Night makes the difference! It ensures that this bike handles aggressively, feels nimble when accelerating, but also converts all watts directly into speed. Thanks to the patented F-Steerer technology, all cables are integrated into the frame. This keeps the front of the frame maximally mud-free, even in the worst conditions. The use of the Essential Carbon brings the X-Night Disc to a more affordable price point. This means it has all the features of our top model, the X-Night SL Disc, but not the price tag!",
